DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTSTAMP:20260901T141149Z
UID:0d5dcfaa94feb9c3@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The best recreational cycling event in the Smokies region retu
 rns on Saturday September 19th\, 2026! The 12th annual 2026 Dancing Bear B
 ike Bash is open for registration! We will have three (tweaked) rides of 2
 5\, 37 and 45 miles with full support. A staple of our event--the famous p
 ost ride gourmet lunch curated by Executive Chef Jeff Carter will be bette
 r than ever ---with fabulous spread\, live music and complimentary Peacefu
 l Side Brewery beer. Packet pick up starts on Friday evening 9/19/26 at Pe
 aceful Side Social from 5:00-6:30 Pm and resumes on Saturday morning of Ra
 ce Day (9/20/26) at 7:30 Am at the Dancing Bean Coffee House. All rides le
 ave around 8:50 Am. Once again\, we will ride through the curves with a fu
 ll police escort! Post ride gourmet lunch starts at 10:30 Am and ends at 1
 :4\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/12th-annual-dancing-bear-bike-bash\n\nS
 ource: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.6787608;-83.7823541
LOCATION:7140 E Lamar Alexander Parkway\, Townsend\, TN
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/12th-annual-dancing-bear-bike-bash
END:VEVENT
