DESCRIPTION:Join North Carolina Cyclo-Cross and friends for pre-season rac
 es to try cyclocross for the first time\, get ready for the season\, or te
 st your fitness and skills! All are welcome! Sunday\, Sept 20 - Ride Rock 
 Creek Sunday\, Sept 27 - hosted by CRAFTED at Cane Creek HQ Race Entry: $3
 0. $15 second race. Fees include a day license if needed. Awards for the t
 op three in each category. All juniors (racing or not) are invited to a FR
 EE INTRO to CX Skills at 9am on each race day for a preview of the course 
 and introduction to cyclocross-specific skills and strategy. Access to Rid
 e Rock Creek is for the event only. Additional downhill riding at Ride Roc
 k Creek is available with purchase of a pass from the venue. All races are
  sanctioned by USA Cycling. Annual or one-day license suggested (one day i
 nc\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/nccx-pre-season-ride-rock-creek\n\nSour
 ce: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
