BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Middle Fork Fondo 2026
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20260901T141149Z
UID:0186abed2e6b428b@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The Middle Fork Fondo 2026 benefits Bikes 4 Kids NC\, supporti
 ng the year-round work that makes it possible to provide bicycles to child
 ren in need at Christmas. There are four scenic routes with minimal elevat
 ion to choose from at distances of 62\, 50\, 35\, 21 miles. An aid station
  will be available for hydration and snacks. There will be 3 optional time
 d sectors for those that want to test their fitness and win the bragging r
 ights for this years event! Must have Strava if you want your time recorde
 d. 9am start time. Beer ticket included with registration for those 21+ **
 *Download your route from the links below *** The roads will not be marked
 . 64 miler https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53353523 50 miler https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/53353522 35 miler https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53353520
  2\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/the-middle-fork-fondo-2026\n\nSource: B
 ikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.3804629;-82.5654982
LOCATION:336 Banner Farm Rd\, Mills River\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/the-middle-fork-fondo-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1000 Mile BikeWalk for Prevention
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20260901T141149Z
UID:ca69c113117cd0e8@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The 1000 Mile BikeWalk for Prevention to be held October 31\, 
 2026\, Halloween morning. THIS IS A NEW DATE. The " Spooktacular " 1000 Mi
 ler is a regional fun ride/walk/run for kids\, teens\, adults... the whole
  family... to enjoy a fun and healthy morning while helping a good cause. 
 Not a timed race\, the 1000 Miler will record the distances traveled by ev
 ery runner and rider to reach the cumulative event goal of 1000 miles. It'
 s Halloween! Costumes and bike decorations are highly encouraged. Teams\, 
 too. Long and short biking and walking circuits of 15 and 5 miles and 1 mi
 le\, respectively\, over semi-closed roadways\, plus a 1/2 mile sidewalk-o
 nly Jr. BikeWaker route for kids. grandparents\, etc.. Prizes will be awar
 ded in each of several classifications for the greatest distance travelled
  during \n\nMore: https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Morristown/1000MileBikeWal
 kForPrevention\n\nSource: RunSignup\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bi
 ke/calendar
LOCATION:4355 Durham Landing Morristown\, Morristown\, TN
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/TN/Morristown/1000MileBikeWalkForPrevention
END:VEVENT
